{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38545","headline":"八月十五夜禁直寄同僚 · 吴融","name":"八月十五夜禁直寄同僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中秋月满尽相寻，独入非烟宿禁林。\n曾恨人间千里隔，更堪天上九门深。\n明涵太液鱼龙定，静鏁圆灵象纬沈。\n目断枚臯何处在，阑干十二忆登临。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}